{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach an object, take it, process it, move to a new location or scan for more objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <SubTree ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    />\"",
